<tr><td>Telangiectases</td><td>Laser therapy、camouflage</td></tr>
<tr><td>Hyper-／hypopigmentation</td><td>Bleaching agents、camouflage、sunscreens、salicylic acid 與 chemical peelings、hydroquinone、retinoids、corticosteroids</td></tr>
